471
00:26:07,275 --> 00:26:09,402
Did you steal a key to the Patent Office?

472
00:26:09,485 --> 00:26:10,653
Yeah, basically.

473
00:26:10,737 --> 00:26:13,823
Let me get this straight.
I got pulled off an oil rig,

474
00:26:13,906 --> 00:26:17,118
