- [ Dan ] You shut up, Quincy.

477
00:26:23,666 --> 00:26:27,086
It's not going to Mars any more.
It's gonna try to save this planet.

478
00:26:27,170 --> 00:26:29,213
And we need to know
what's wrong with it pretty quick.

479
00:26:29,297 --> 00:26:31,257
You said we did a bad job
of putting it together?

480
00:26:31,340 --> 00:26:34,844
No, I said you did a piss poor job
of putting it together.

481
00:26:34,927 --> 00:26:38,473
First of all, you got the flow system
