488
00:26:52,945 --> 00:26:54,655
Eight whole months?

489
00:26:54,739 --> 00:26:57,033
- Well, pretty much, yeah.
- Well, gee whiz.

490
00:26:57,116 --> 00:26:59,410
Well, this is the team
